OL,5,G0935 Outback Truckers
OL,6,     FIn Townsville, Queensland,
OL,7,     Flong-distance trucker Peter is
OL,8,     Fgetting set for a cross-country
OL,9,     Fhaul. He has to move a load of
OL,10,     Fmixed freight through bush,
OL,11,     Ffarmland and desert to Darwin.
OL,12,G1030 Outback Truckers
OL,13,     FMatt Adams rides a volatile load
OL,14,     Finto a world of trouble with a
OL,15,     Fbull on board. The Kendalls share
OL,16,     Fa family trucking experience and
OL,17,     Fanother haul carries a sting...
